# TabbyWebRTC Scripts

Developer and CI utility scripts for local development, AWS deployment, and release management.

Run any script with `--help` for usage and prerequisites.

## Prerequisites

| Tool | Used by |
|---|---|
| Node.js 22+ | setup-dev, dev-frontend, deploy-* |
| Rust stable | setup-dev |
| AWS CLI v2 | setup-dev, bootstrap-aws, deploy-*, check-costs |
| AWS SAM CLI | dev-backend |
| GitHub CLI (`gh`) | rotate-secrets |
| OpenSSL | rotate-secrets |
| SSH | provision-turn |

## Quick start

```bash
./scripts/setup-dev.sh
./scripts/dev-backend.sh    # terminal 1
./scripts/dev-frontend.sh   # terminal 2 (set CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY)
```

## Script reference

| Script | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `setup-dev.sh` | One-time dev machine setup |
| `dev-backend.sh` | SAM local API on port 3001 |
| `dev-frontend.sh` | Vite dev server on port 5173 |
| `deploy-dev.sh` | Deploy TabbyWebRTCDev CDK stack |
| `deploy-prod.sh` | Deploy TabbyWebRTCProd (requires confirmation) |
| `bootstrap-aws.sh` | CDK bootstrap + GitHub OIDC deploy role |
| `provision-turn.sh` | SSH CoTURN install on Hetzner VPS |
| `rotate-secrets.sh` | Rotate TABBYWEBRTC_JWT_SECRET in GitHub Secrets |
| `release.sh` | Tag version and push to trigger release workflow |
| `check-costs.sh` | Query AWS Cost Explorer for tabbywebrtc-tagged spend |

## Local backend env

Copy `scripts/env.local.json.example` to `infra/env.local.json` and edit values before running `dev-backend.sh`. `setup-dev.sh` copies this automatically if the file is missing.
